  "markdown": "# Content model catalogue\n\nNamespace: example.customer-story\nCMMF version: 1.2.0\n\n## Relationships\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  m0[\"customer (entry)\"]\n  m1[\"customer-story (entry)\"]\n  m2[\"quote (object)\"]\n  m1 -->|\"customer / reference / singular / linked\"| m0\n  m1 -.->|\"quote / object / singular\"| m2\n```\n\n## Customer (customer)\n\nKind: entry\n\nA reusable organisation profile that can be linked from more than one customer story.\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Localised | Repeatable | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| name | string | true | false | false |  |\n| website | string | false | false | false |  |\n| logo | asset | false | false | false |  |\n\neditorial:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"labelField\": \"name\",\n  \"preview\": {\n    \"title\": \"name\",\n    \"image\": \"logo\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Customer Story (customer-story)\n\nKind: entry\n\nEvidence of a customer outcome, told through a specific challenge, response and result.\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Localised | Repeatable | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| title | string | true | false | false |  |\n| slug | slug | true | false | false |  |\n| summary | text | false | false | false |  |\n| story | richText | true | false | false |  |\n| customer | reference | true | false | false |  |\n| quote | object | false | false | false |  |\n\neditorial:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"labelField\": \"title\",\n  \"preview\": {\n    \"title\": \"title\",\n    \"description\": \"summary\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\ngovernance:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"owner\": \"content-team\",\n  \"maturity\": \"proposed\"\n}\n```\n\n## Quote (quote)\n\nKind: object\n\nA quotation and attribution embedded in one customer story, rather than a separately maintained content item.\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Localised | Repeatable | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| text | text | true | false | false |  |\n| attribution | string | true | false | false |  |\n| role | string | false | false | false |  |\n\neditorial:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"labelField\": \"attribution\"\n}\n```\n\n"
}
